{
  "$comment": [
    "Opt-in hooks. Install with `ws hooks install`, remove with `ws hooks remove`. Both merge:",
    "only commands that run .agents/bin/ws or its helpers are touched; your own settings",
    "(permissions, other hooks) stay as they are.",
    "",
    "They record AGENT working hours automatically, so the numbers do not depend on",
    "anyone remembering: the clock opens when a prompt is submitted and closes when the",
    "turn stops or the session ends, so time spent waiting for a person is not agent",
    "time. Human hours stay manual on purpose: `ws clock in/out`.",
    "`ws agent auto` never fails and records nothing when it cannot tell which",
    "project the session belongs to - an hour on the wrong project is worse than none.",
    "",
    "The activity hooks tell the desk what this session is doing (reading, typing,",
    "running, waiting for you) - a tool name at most, never its input or a prompt",
    "(ADR-0023). They call the Python helper directly to keep each tool call fast.",
    "",
    "Every command runs from $CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR, not the shell's current directory: an",
    "agent that cd's into a worktree must still clock and report against this workspace.",
    "",
    "PreCompact and SessionStart(compact) keep this session's run and memory",
    "continuous across a compaction: checkpoint locally before the transcript is folded,",
    "and never publish from the compaction hook. A configured auto mode publishes only",
    "from the normal stop checkpoint after its remote guards pass.",
    "then remind the agent which project's allowlist still applies after.",
    "See docs/memory-and-runs.md#compaction."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "compact",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws session compact-reminder || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws agent auto in || true" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws checkpoint --no-publish || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws checkpoint || true" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws agent auto out || true" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws agent auto out || true" },
          { "type": "command", "command": "python3 \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\"/.agents/bin/ws_activity.py hook \"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR:-.}\" || true" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
